3088379,"x":0.8022222272344699,"text":"B have you hidden"},{"x":0.54222222638670059,"text":"C were you hiding","y":0.32122093067077251,"w":0.14222221374511723,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"text":"SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT","x":0.50444444927483179,"y":0.35306122479732394,"h":0.013217845060387479,"w":0.27111110687255857},{"x":0.4955555599555555,"y":0.379183673517965,"h":0.011836734693877693,"w":0.44,"text":"10 Read the task below. Before you start writing, note"},{"text":"down some ideas and plan your narrative.","h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.52888890367971442,"y":0.39387755114701484,"w":0.33555553436279295},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.41860465133453206,"w":0.34666664123535151,"text":"Write a narrative about a strange person in","x":0.5266666837156575},{"text":"a scary place.","w":0.10892474174499511,"x":0.52887096294171865,"y":0.43306772403618776,"h":0.011771527893689293},{"y":0.45058139559325294,"text":"• Write when and where the story takes place,","x":0.52888889966338426,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.35333332061767575},{"y":0.46511627945341227,"text":"and who the main characters are.","x":0.54222222435782896,"h":0.010174418079609726,"w":0.25333332061767577},{"text":"• Decide what happens and how the story ends.","y":0.47959183675598616,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.37111110687255855,"x":0.52666666260075801},{"x":0.02222222244224803,"y":0.45930232567434248,"h":0.010174418079609726,"w":0.01111111044883728,"text":"1"},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.024444452201515431,"text":"'What a boring day!' sighed Robbie, sitting in the lobby","y":0.47673469385013878,"w":0.4222222137451172},{"h":0.013111058449258639,"y":0.48979591841426662,"w":0.4222222137451172,"x":0.024444452905219124,"text":"of his hotel. He'd been looking forward to his holiday"},{"w":0.42222221374511726,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.50436046521534605,"x":0.024444449794108002,"text":"on the island, but it wasn't much fun there on his own."},{"text":"He'd already explored the place by jet pack the previous","x":0.024444459995623297,"w":0.42444442749023442,"y":0.51877551027624635,"h":0.013201234000069673},{"w":0.42444442749023442,"h":0.013100379632443704,"text":"day. As he flew over the beaches and the villages,","x":0.024444459995623297,"y":0.53343023241942045},{"x":0.024444454335606523,"text":"he live-streamed it to his sister back in the UK.","y":0.54796511643627632,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.35333332061767575},{"w":0.013333332538604734,"x":0.024444444975142074,"y":0.56686046530612533,"h":0.010174418079609837,"text":"2"},{"h":0.013081395674724994,"w":0.42222221374511715,"text":"He picked up a brochure about a cave. You should visit","x":0.026666675127441336,"y":0.58284883697368395},{"h":0.014498247419084898,"y":0.59626955722651664,"text":"it suggested the owner, who knew the island well.","w":0.42025699615478518,"x":0.026533000609675738},{"text":"What is there to see asked Robbie. There are strange","y":0.61183673483858914,"x":0.026666676182996802,"w":0.42222221374511726,"h":0.011836734693877471},{"h":0.013138348326391047,"text":"wall paintings and some writing in a language no one","x":0.024444447328957109,"w":0.42444442749023437,"y":0.62645348842717241},{"x":0.026666675127441336,"w":0.42222221374511715,"text":"understands he replied. Wow said Robbie. Suddenly, he","y":0.64081632670783606,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.42666664123535158,"text":"was interested. He was studying ancient languages at","y":0.65551020427147888,"x":0.024444462493435209},{"x":0.026666673016330265,"text":"university and was excited by the idea of the mysterious","y":0.66857142871569397,"h":0.013114617795360384,"w":0.4222222137451172},{"text":"writing. He decided to go the next day.","w":0.29333332061767575,"h":0.011836734693877471,"x":0.026666677913384156,"y":0.68448979579749825},{"w":0.013333332538604734,"y":0.70203488381387724,"h":0.010174418079609837,"text":"3","x":0.02666666691588282},{"x":0.026666665053367566,"h":0.013176317020338391,"text":"Early in the morning, Robbie set off. After hiking up","w":0.4222222137451172,"y":0.71947674424112584},{"y":0.73387755120120202,"x":0.026666680449327167,"w":0.42444442749023437,"text":"a mountain, he eventually found the entrance to the","h":0.011836734693877471},{"x":0.02666666562744158,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.74854651194499711,"text":"cave. As he approached, he saw a young woman there.","w":0.42222221374511715},{"text":"Hi. Have you been inside yet he asked her. Why are you","h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.76308139552057863,"w":0.42444442749023437,"x":0.026666680449327167},{"y":0.77616279031670732,"w":0.42444442749023437,"x":0.026666678662290125,"h":0.013224964531100447,"text":"here she snapped. Robbie was shocked. Err ... umm ..."},{"y":0.79061224519337481,"h":0.013166824652224074,"w":0.42444442749023437,"x":0.026666678680808714,"text":"I just want to see the cave he said. Go away she yelled at"},{"x":0.028888896645959859,"y":0.805232558335501,"text":"him. This is my home and I have come back after many","w":0.4222222137451172,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"text":"centuries she continued.","w":0.18888887405395507,"y":0.82122093051930367,"x":0.028888899454503836,"h":0.010207640978754817},{"x":0.028888889331136914,"y":0.83866279092016049,"w":0.011111110448837277,"text":"4","h":0.0087209296713069984},{"x":0.028888894071885822,"y":0.85591836742892058,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.4222222137451172,"text":"Centuries? What was she talking about? Robbie looked"},{"w":0.4222222137451172,"text":"at her closely then and realised she had live snakes","x":0.028888887849663761,"h":0.010204081632653073,"y":0.87061224497069722},{"text":"instead of hair! 'You're a monster!' he gasped. He turned","y":0.88367346951181169,"x":0.026666668069697898,"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.42444442749023431},{"text":"and ran like the wind down the mountain. Robbie left the","y":0.89825581439170266,"h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.028888888905219366,"w":0.42222221374511726},{"w":0.42444442749023437,"text